changes.old_desc:
Mutual exclusion with fencing tokens. acquire(holder) returns owner_token and fence (globally increasing);
pass fence to downstream writes so a stale holder can be rejected. Holds expire after hold_seconds (default 60)
unless renewed. 409 unavailable means held: retry after Retry-After or wait_secon

